Maintainer: Adriano Rutz <adafede@gmail.com>
Description: Infrastructure and curated ethnobotanical and phytochemical
    datasets for analyzing plant families, including phylogenetic
    integration and visualization tools. Includes vendored functions
    from the 'cascade' package (<https://github.com/adafede/cascade>)
    to minimize the dependency tree.
